@startuml cutting_tool_states
title Lasso Cutting Tool - Interaction States

skinparam backgroundColor #EDF3F7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #4A3026
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #6F96AD
  FontColor #4A3026
  StartColor #AA8065
  EndColor #AA8065
}

[*] --> Editing : garment loaded
Editing --> Tracing : choose Cut and begin lasso
Tracing --> Tracing : add pointer path
Tracing --> Previewing : close lasso
Tracing --> Editing : cancel / invalid open path

state Previewing {
  [*] --> ShadingSelection
  ShadingSelection : Shade area proposed for removal
  ShadingSelection : Show pieces that will become disconnected
}

Previewing --> Editing : cancel
Previewing --> CutApplied : apply cut
CutApplied : Selected area removed
CutApplied : Disconnected pieces remain
CutApplied --> ArrangingPieces : select a disconnected piece
ArrangingPieces --> ArrangingPieces : move or rotate piece
ArrangingPieces --> CutApplied : finish arranging
CutApplied --> Editing : continue designing
CutApplied --> Editing : undo / restore pre-cut shape
Editing --> [*] : leave or save design

note right of Previewing
  No destructive change occurs
  before explicit confirmation.
end note
@enduml
